{{$NEXT}}

  - Initial release
  - Vendor tree-sitter v0.20.8 (C99 library, single-translation-unit build)
  - Build static archive libtree-sitter.a from share/tree-sitter/src/lib.c
  - Ship a tree-sitter.pc with the share build that names the install
    prefix, so cflags (-I include), libs (-L lib -ltree-sitter) and version
    describe the vendored library
  - Prefer a system libtree-sitter from the 0.20.x series: 0.21.0 and newer
    no longer install tree_sitter/parser.h, which grammars targeting 0.20.x
    include
  - Compatible with grammars that target the 0.20.x tree-sitter ABI
    (e.g. tree-sitter-bash 0.20.5)
  - Tests cover both install types and the version window of the system probe
